// Use the shared block +validator without defining it in the diagram
architecture Vote on a block

box proposer as Proposer [note: builds the block, icon: server]
+validator v as Validators [note: check and vote]
box chain as Chain [note: finalizes the block, icon: chain]

step Propose
  say The proposer sends the new block to the validators.
  proposer -> v: new block

step Vote
  say The validators check the block and vote, and enough votes finalize it on the chain.
  v -> chain: votes
